- [Kelly] Aww.

00:02:25.459 --> 00:02:27.180
(audience cheering)

00:02:27.180 --> 00:02:28.560
- Two way street, two way street.

00:02:28.560 --> 00:02:31.110
- I remember when we were on set one day

00:02:31.110 --> 00:02:32.640
we were looking at all like, you know,

00:02:32.640 --> 00:02:34.770
Pierce was like, oh this
