rest is a discipline.

00:03:41.010 --> 00:03:41.843
- [Kelly] Boy.

00:03:41.843 --> 00:03:42.676
- Yeah.
- Yeah.

00:03:42.676 --> 00:03:44.070
I know, I wrote a whole song
about it, called Be Still

00:03:44.070 --> 00:03:44.940
just 'cause I can't.

00:03:44.940 --> 00:03:47.460
So I was like, maybe I right about it.

00:03:47.460 --> 00:03:49.860
It'll just kinda happen. I was like, yeah.

00:03:49.860 --> 00:03:51.030
It's very hard for me to do too.

00:03:51.030 --> 00:03:52.740
But Noah, I wanna ask
you, so what was it like

00:03:52.740 --> 00:03:54.053
