00:04:07.650 --> 00:04:08.940
maybe in the comics of course.

00:04:08.940 --> 00:04:10.008
- [Kelly] Yeah.

00:04:10.008 --> 00:04:14.310
- Is an honor and to join
alongside these legends

00:04:14.310 --> 00:04:15.720
