00:04:26.100 --> 00:04:28.200
And it comes through,
it came through on set,

00:04:28.200 --> 00:04:30.870
and I think it's now a
passion project for all of us.

00:04:30.870 --> 00:04:31.703
- Wow.

00:04:33.246 --> 00:04:37.938
- You guys, your characters,
are so funny, man.

00:04:37.938 --> 00:04:42.900
You're like, we are gonna
have a talk about this later.

00:04:42.900 --> 00:04:44.160
Like, it's like amazing.

