00:05:00.480 --> 00:05:01.440
I was right, yeah, okay.

00:05:01.440 --> 00:05:04.350
We're on the same page,
cool, cool, cool, cool.

00:05:04.350 --> 00:05:05.820
And we were Atlanta and then we-

00:05:05.820 --> 00:05:07.350
I was like, let's grab coffee.

00:05:07.350 --> 00:05:08.183
- Yeah.

00:05:08.183 --> 00:05:09.780
- We hung out for 2, 3, 4 hours.

00:05:09.780 --> 00:05:11.460
Walked around, found an art commune.

00:05:11.460 --> 00:05:14.850
